    "workingPrinciple": "The HC-SR04 sends eight 40kHz sonic burst cycles upon receiving a 10-microsecond HIGH trigger pulse. When the sonic wave hits an obstacle and reflects back, the Echo pin goes HIGH for a duration equal to the round-trip flight time. Distance is computed using the formula: Distance (cm) = (Echo Time in microseconds) * 0.0343 / 2.",
